{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04044","headline":"送吏部李侍郎东归得归字 · 苏頲","name":"送吏部李侍郎东归得归字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陌上有光辉，披云向洛畿。\n赏来荣扈从，别至惜分飞。\n泉溜含风急，山烟带日微。\n茂曹今去矣，人物喜东归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04044.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04044","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}